.Sh CAVEATS
A request whose MBZ octets after its Sequence Number were rewritten on
the way no longer looks authenticated: it is answered as an
unauthenticated one, unless
.Fl A ,
and an authenticated sender takes no such reply.
The user
.Ql _stampd
is made by the package; built from the sources, make it with
.Xr pw 8 :
.Ql pw useradd _stampd -d /var/empty -s /usr/sbin/nologin .
